1
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:08,100
Man, I sure miss Julie.
我好想念茱莉

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,620
Spanish midgets.
西班牙侏儒

3
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,960
Spanish midgets wrestling...
西班牙侏儒摔角…

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,260
Julie.
茱莉…

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,760
Okay, yes, I see how you got there.
茱莉！我明白是怎麼想到她的

6
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,220
You ever figure out what that thing's for?
你有想過電話用來做什麼嗎？

7
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,820
Oh, see, I'm trying this new screening thing, you know?
我在過濾電話

8
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,380
I figure if I'm always answering the phone, people will think I don't have a life.
我想如果我老是去接的話 大家會以為我沒有生活

9
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,620
My God, Rodrigo never gets pinned.
老天啊，羅裡哥真是西方不敗

10
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,620
Hello, I'm looking for Bob.
我要找小包

11
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:40,900
This is Jade.
我是小潔

12
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,560
I don't know if you're still at this number, but I was just thinking about us and how great
我不知道你的電話改了沒有 不過我不斷在想…

13
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,020
it was.

14
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:51,480
And, well, I know it's been three years, but I was kind of hoping we could hook up again.
…可是我希望我們能夠重修舊好

15
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:55,920
You know, I barely had the nerve to make this call, so you know what I did?
我提不起勇氣打電話…

16
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:56,520
What?
什麼派對？

17
00:00:56,520 --> 00:01:00,420
I got a little drunk, and naked.
我喝得茫茫的…

18
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:01,440
Bob here.
我是小包

19
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:14,000
So no one told you life was gonna be this way.

20
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:19,160
Your job's a joke, you're broke, and love life's the only way.

21
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:23,500
It's like you're always stuck in second gear.

22
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:26,500
When it hasn't been your day, why are you still here?

23
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:32,660
I'll be there for you

24
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:35,000
When the rain starts to pour

25
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,620
I'll be there for you

26
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:40,000
Like I've never been before

27
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,020
I'll be there for you

28
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:45,280
Cause you're there for me too

29
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:54,900
So, uh, what have you been up to?
你近來都在幹什麼呢？

30
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:58,740
Oh, you know, teaching aerobics
教有氣舞蹈…

31
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:00,900
Partying way too much
…玩得太瘋狂

32
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:04,060
Oh, and in case you were wondering
如果你想知道的話…

33
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:06,860
Those are my legs on the new James Bond poster
…新007電影海報上那雙腿 是我的

34
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:13,000
Can you hold on a moment? I have another call
你請等一下，我有插撥

35
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:14,260
I love her
我愛她 我知道

36
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:14,760
I know
我不知道

37
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:17,240
I'm back

38
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,480
So, are we gonna get together or what?
我回來了 那我們到底要不要聚一聚啊？

39
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:20,700
Uh, absolutely
當然要了

40
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,900
Uh, how about tomorrow afternoon?
明天下午怎麼樣？

41
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:25,100
Do you know, uh, Central Perk in the village?

42
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:25,880
Say five-ish?

43
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,620
Great, I'll see you then
太棒了，到時候見

44
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:28,620
Okay

45
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,320
Okay

46
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:35,280
Having a phone has finally paid off
我裝上電話，終於物有所值了

47
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:39,860
Okay, even though you do do a good Bob impression
就算你裝小包裝得很像…

48
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,600
I'm thinking when she sees you tomorrow
…等到她明天一看到你…

49
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:43,800
She may realize that, hey, you're not Bob
…就會發現你不是小包了

50
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,480
Ah, you see, Tattoo

51
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:52,180
Miss Jade's fantasy is to rekindle the love she once had with Bob

52
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,600
You know what my fantasy is?

53
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,300
That you talk like a normal person

54
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:58,640
I am hoping that when Bob doesn't show up
我只希望當她知道 小包放她鴿子的時候…

55
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:03,100
She will seek comfort in the open arms of the wry stranger at the next table
…她會投向鄰桌的 陌生人的懷抱

56
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:05,920
Oh my God, you are pure evil
老天，你真是邪惡到家

57
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:09,080
Okay, pure evil
邪惡到家…

58
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,520
Horny and alone
…飢渴兼孤單

59
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:16,060
I've done this
這我都試過了

60
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:24,520
Yeah, yeah, everybody's here
對，大家都在

61
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:27,880
Hey, everybody, say hi to Julie in New Mexico
各位，跟新墨西哥的茱莉 打聲招呼吧

62
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,080
Hi, Julie
茱莉…

63
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,640
Hi, Julie
茱莉…

64
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,720
Hi, Julie
茱莉…

65
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,740
Okay, while Ross is on the phone
趁羅斯在講電話…

66
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:36,740
Everybody owes me 62 bucks for his birthday
…每人繳62塊慶祝他的生日

67
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:42,100
Um, is there any chance that you're rounding up for...
你可不可以將就一下…

68
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:45,460
You know, like from like 20?

69
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,880
Hey, come on, we got the gift, the concert and the cake
少來了 要有禮物，演唱會，還有蛋糕

70
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,500
Do we need a cake?
蛋糕需要嗎？

71
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,460
Look, guys, I know it's a little steep
各位，我知道這數目多了一點

72
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,680
Yeah, whoosh

73
00:03:58,420 --> 00:03:59,500
But it's Ross
不過是羅斯的生日呀

74
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,300
Yeah, it's all right

75
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:03,000
Hey, Ryan

76
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,360
All right, okay, I'll see you guys later

77
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,060
I gotta go do a thing

78
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:11,060
Okay, sweetie, I'll call you later tonight
好了，甜心，我晚上再打給你

79
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,320
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa

80
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,740
Hey, hey, hey, you're not really gonna go through with this, are you?
你不是真的要那麼做吧，老兄

81
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,340
You know, I think I might just
我非做不可

82
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:21,660
So, uh, what are you guys doing for dinner tonight?
你們晚上吃什麼？

83
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,900
Well, I guess I gotta start saving up for Ross's birthday
我想我要開始 為羅斯的生日存錢了

84
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:29,480
So I guess I'll just stay home and eat dust bunnies
我的菜單是在家裡吃西北風

85
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:32,740
Can you believe how much this is gonna cost?
這個可要花很多錢啊

86
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:37,740
Do you guys ever get the feeling that Chandler and those guys
你們有時候會不會覺得…

87
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:41,420
Just don't get that we don't make as much money as they do?
…根本不明白 我們賺的錢沒他們多

88
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,560
Yes, yeah

89
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:42,880
Really?

90
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,740
It's like they're always saying, let's go here, let's go there
他們總是說 「咱們去這兒，去那兒」

91
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:47,980
Like we can afford to go here and there
好像我們真的有那個閒錢一樣

92
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:52,660
Yes, yes, and it's, and we always have to go to, you know, someplace nice
而且我們總是得去「好地方」 你知道嗎？

93
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:56,840
You know, God, it's not like we can say anything about it

94
00:04:56,840 --> 00:05:00,300
Because, like, this is a birthday thing, you know, and it's for Ross

95
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,280
For Ross
羅斯的…

96
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:01,880
For Ross
羅斯的…

97
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,480
For Ross
羅斯的…

98
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,280
Oh, my God
老天

99
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,100
Hey

100
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:06,380
Hi

101
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:06,740
What?
什麼派對？

102
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:08,660
Okay, I'm at work
我在上班…

103
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:12,040
It's an ordinary day, you know, chop, chop, chop, saute, saute, saute
…跟平常的一天一樣 切切切，煎煎煎

104
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:16,320
All of a sudden, Leon, the manager, calls me into his office
突然間呢，我們經理李昂 叫我去他的辦公室

105
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:19,740
Turns out they fired the head lunch chef, and guess who got the job?
原來他們開除了午餐大廚 你們猜誰取代他的職位了？

106
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:21,820
If it's not you, this is a horrible story
如果不是你的話 這可是個糟透的故事

107
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,460
Fortunately, it is me
幸好，那個人是我

108
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:28,840
And they made me head of purchasing, thank you very much
他們還升我為採購主任 感激不盡

109
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:29,800
Sweet

110
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:33,020
Anyway, I just ran into Chandler and Ross downstairs

111
00:05:33,020 --> 00:05:35,580
And I think we should go out and celebrate, you know, someplace nice
我認為我們該出去慶祝一下

112
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,620
Someplace nice
去個好地方

113
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:54,720
I'm telling you, you can't do this
說真的，你不能夠這麼做

114
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,900
Oh, come on, I can never get a girl like that with conventional methods
少來了，拘泥於那種傳統方法 我永遠把不到那種尤物

115
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:01,880
That doesn't matter, she wanted to call Bob

116
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:05,580
No, hey, for all we know, Bob is who she was meant to be with
她要找的是小包 小包一定是她理想的對象

117
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:08,380
You may be destroying two people's chance for happiness
你這麼做 或許會毀了兩個人快樂的機會

118
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:09,760
We don't know Bob
我們不認識小包

119
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:14,120
Okay, we know me, we like me, please let me be happy
我們認識我，我們喜歡我 拜託，讓我快樂起來

120
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:18,120
Go over there and tell that woman the truth
你過去告訴那個女人實話

121
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:20,740
All right
好吧

122
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,200
Go
去啊

123
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,400
Hi

124
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:33,140
Hi

125
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:38,360
Listen, I have to, um, ahem, I have to confess something
我要跟你招認一件事

126
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:39,940
Yes?
什麼事？

127
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:44,580
Whoever stood you up is a jerk
放你鴿子的人是混蛋

128
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:47,500
I don't know
我不知道

129
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:54,580
I just had this weird sense, you know, but that's me, I'm weird and sensitive
我就是有這種怪怪的感應 我就這樣，怪怪的又敏感

130
00:06:57,660 --> 00:06:58,160
Tissue?
面紙？

131
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,460
Thanks
謝謝

132
00:07:02,300 --> 00:07:03,720
No, you keep the pack
不用，你整包留著吧

133
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,340
I'm all cried out today
我今天已經「哭」干了

134
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,380
I don't know
我不知道

135
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,960
Okay, okay

136
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:26,180
Here is to my sister, the newly appointed head lunch chef
我敬我剛剛被升為 午餐大廚的老妹一杯

137
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,560
Who's also in charge of purchasing
而且她還接掌了採買大權

138
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:31,300
Newly appointed head lunch chef, who's also in charge of purchasing
恭賀她升為午餐大廚 並且接掌採買大權…

139
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:33,560
Who has her own little desk when Roland's not there
羅不在的時候 她有自己的小辦公桌

140
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:39,280
Lunch chef purchasing, own little desk when Roland's not there
午餐大廚，採購，羅不在時 有自己的小辦公桌

141
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,700
Here's to my little sister

142
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:42,360
Oh, wait, and I got a paper

143
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,760
Oh, cool

144
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,660
That's fine, I'll just wait
沒關係，我等好了

145
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:48,280
Oh, sorry

146
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,200
Oh, sorry, sorry

147
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:51,760
Monica
敬摩妮卡

148
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,380
Are we ready to order?
各位可以點菜了嗎？

149
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,460
Oh, you know what, we haven't even looked yet
對不起，我們還沒看菜單

150
00:07:58,460 --> 00:08:00,240
Well, when you do, just let me know
那你們看過之後再叫我

151
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,380
I'll be right over there on the edge of my seat
我會在那邊引頸企盼的

152
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:10,200
Wow, look at these prices
你們看看這上面的價錢

153
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,700
Yeah, these are pretty ch-ching
是呀，都是什麼雞的

154
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,100
What are these, like famous chickens?
這什麼？名牌雞嗎？

155
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,340
Sorry I'm late

156
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,600
Congratulations, Mom
抱歉，我遲到了 摩妮卡，恭喜你

157
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,280
Thanks
謝謝

158
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,480
I'm not sorry I'm late

159
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,120
How incredible was my afternoon with Jade?
我不後悔我遲到，我跟小潔的 午後約會太不可思議了

160
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:29,400
Well, pretty incredible according to the message she left for you on my machine
根據她在我答錄機上 留給你的話的確很不可思議

161
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:33,300
Hey, Chandler, why is this woman leaving a message for you on my machine?
錢德，這個女人為什麼 會在我的答錄機留話給你呢？

162
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:36,600
Oh, see, I had to tell her that my number was your number
我必須要告訴她 我的號碼是你的號碼…

163
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,620
because I couldn't tell her that my number was my number
…因為我不能告訴她 我的號碼是我的號碼…

164
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,580
because she thinks that my number is Bob's number
…因為她以為 我的號碼是小包的號碼

165
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:45,360
Hey, tell me again, what do I do when Mr. Roper calls?
你再告訴我一次 羅先生打來的時候我怎麼辦？

166
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:49,180
Do I dare ask?
可以點菜了嗎？

167
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:53,000
Yes, I'll start with the carpaccio and then I'll have the grilled prawns
好，我要先來一份生牛肉 然後再來一份烤蝦

168
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,440
That sounds great, same for me
聽起來不錯，我也一樣

169
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,780
And for the gentleman?
那這位先生呢？

170
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:58,040
Yeah, I'll have the Thai chicken pizza
我要泰國雞肉披薩

171
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:02,120
But hey, look, if I get it without the knots and leaks and stuff, is it cheaper?
如果我的披薩少加乾果，大蒜…

172
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,140
You'd think, wouldn't you?
你是那麼想嗎？

173
00:09:06,620 --> 00:09:07,100
Miss?
面紙？

174
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:11,700
Okay, I will have the side salad
好了，我想要點…伴碟沙拉

175
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,400
And what would that be on the side of?
那要伴在什麼菜旁邊呢？

176
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:19,180
I don't know, why don't you just put it right here next to my water?
你就幫我放在我的水旁邊好了

177
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,140
And for you?
那你呢？

178
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:32,540
Um, I'm gonna have a cup of the cucumber soup and, um, take care
我想我要來一碗黃瓜湯…

179
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,700
I will have the Cajun catfish
我要一份紐奧良鯰魚

180
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:39,320
Anything else?
就這樣嗎？

181
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:41,320
Yes, how about a verse of Killing Me Softly?
還有一首「情歌迷死人」 怎麼樣？

182
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,220
You're gonna sneeze on my fish, aren't you?
你會朝我的魚打噴嚏 對不對？

183
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:54,540
Whoa, does anybody else feel like they just gave birth to an alien?

184
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:55,540
Yes
什麼事？

185
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,200
No
不行

