00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:22,880
With food and music and, and, and the band
有吃的，有音樂，還有…

373
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:23,180
Oh

374
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:26,460
You partied with Hootie and the Blowfish?
你們跟「混混與自大狂」混？

375
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:30,420
Yes, apparently Stevie and Hootie are like this
對，很顯然史提跟混混是死黨

376
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,460
Who gave you that hickey?
那吻痕是誰給的？

377
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:35,300
That would be the work of a Blowfish
是其中一個自大狂弄的

378
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:35,580
Oh

379
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:42,280
I can't believe it, I can't believe this
我真不敢相信

380
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:47,220
It's awkward, it's like sitting at home and just trying to guess Joey's fingers and
我們只是坐在家裡頭 猜喬伊的手指頭…

381
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:52,400
And you guys are out like partying and having fun and, you know, I'll
而你們卻跑出去瘋狂作樂說：

382
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:54,200
Hey, Blowfish, suck on my neck
「自大狂吸我脖子」

383
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:54,520
Oh

384
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:00,820
Hey, look, don't blame us, you guys could have been there, you know
不要怪我們 本來你們也可以去的

385
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:03,760
Oh, what, as part of your poor friend's outreach program?
什麼？當被你們施捨的 窮朋友，是不是？

386
00:21:05,420 --> 00:21:06,760
But great, it's work
帥，是公司

387
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:10,920
Look, I don't know what to say, I'm, I'm sorry that we make more money than you
我不曉得該說什麼 很抱歉我們賺的錢比你們多

388
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:14,400
But we're not gonna feel guilty about it, we work really hard for it
可是我們不想因此有罪惡感 我們很努力的賺錢啊

389
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:15,740
And we don't work hard?
我們就不努力？

390
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:18,000
Yeah, hi, it's Monica, I just got a page
我是摩妮卡 剛剛有人CALL我

391
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:22,260
I'm just saying that we, sometimes we like to do stuff that costs a little more
有時候我們會想做 比較花錢的事情嘛

392
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:24,300
Oh, and you feel like we hold you back?
是我們拖住你了

393
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:24,760
Yes
什麼事？

394
00:21:25,540 --> 00:21:25,940
No
不行

395
00:21:29,760 --> 00:21:32,120
Leon, Leon, wait, wait, shh, guys

396
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:37,140
Wait, I don't understand, those steaks were just a gift from the meat vendor
那些牛排只是肉商送來的禮物

397
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:39,060
That was not a kickback
可不是回扣啊

398
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:42,720
All right, I mean, come on, I'll just replace them and we can forget the whole thing
那我買回去還他們 我們把這件事忘掉好了

399
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:46,780
What corporate policy?
什麼公司政策啊？

400
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:48,960
No
不行

401
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:53,140
Yeah

402
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:54,940
Okay

403
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:02,220
I just got fired
我被開除了

404
00:22:02,820 --> 00:22:03,200
Oh

405
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,560
Oh, what?

406
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:06,920
Hi

407
00:22:08,540 --> 00:22:10,980
Here's your check, that'll be $4.12
你們的帳單，一共四塊兩毛

408
00:22:10,980 --> 00:22:11,960
Let me get that
我來付

409
00:22:16,080 --> 00:22:17,440
You got five bucks
你有沒有五塊啊？

410
00:22:26,820 --> 00:22:29,180
Here comes the beep, you know what to do
嗶一聲過後，你知道怎麼做

411
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:32,000
Hi, it's me
是我

412
00:22:35,980 --> 00:22:38,680
Listen, Bob, I'm probably way out of line here
小包 也許我不該做這樣的要求

413
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:40,760
I mean, it has been three years

414
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,640
And you're probably seeing someone else now
我是說都過三年了 說不定你另外有女朋友了…

415
00:22:43,180 --> 00:22:45,220
But if we could just have one night together
…我們如果能在一起一個晚上 看在往日的份上…

416
00:22:45,220 --> 00:22:46,860
Just for old times' sake

417
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:51,040
One hot, steamy, wild night
乾柴烈火的一晚…